  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 3 December 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nWelcome to your next venture! Situated on a sprawling 1012m² (approx.) freehold site, this property offers a rare opportunity for the savvy investors or homebuyers.\r\n\r\nUnlock the Possibilities:\r\n- Zoned Mixed Housing Suburban with great subdivision potential\r\n- Do-up opportunity bursting with potential\r\n- Located in the sought-after Rangitoto College zone\r\n- Amazing sea views\r\n- Ample spaces for car parking, or even a boat or caravan\r\n- Easy access to the motorway and public transport for convenience\r\n- Close to Browns Bay Beach, Albany Mall, and Mega Centre, shops, and eateries, every amenity is within reach.\r\n\r\nVersatile Layout:\r\n- 2 bedrooms upstairs, 2 bedrooms downstairs, with a spacious living room\r\n- Ideal for a home office or accommodating extended family\r\n\r\nDon't Miss Out!  Make your move today and step into a world of endless possibilities. Contact us now to arrange a viewing and start envisioning your future in this incredible property!",
